CLAIM_RE = re.compile(r"\b(C2|C\^?\{?1,1\}?|C1,1|H2_?loc|H\^2_loc|C0)\b\s+is\s+(?:a\s+)?strictly\s+(larger|smaller)\s+extension\s+class")
```
